going, friendly, flirty and loves fashion. However she is also very domestic, loving to cook, clean and look after people. She has a little fairy companion, Alisa, who is a NEET mangaka who hates to work. If possible, I would like Alisa included but it is fine if it is just Seo.\nI look forward to your work!\n\nSeo: https://photos.app.goo.gl/5nG89M2fYF6M4wmc9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@immm86/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/59b397c8/uploads/origins/f314858e-dd08-4d29-a644-af673a789c41?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aef054e590c7a433fedf233f712d163c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/59b397c8/uploads/origins/f314858e-dd08-4d29-a644-af673a789c41?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aef054e590c7a433fedf233f712d163c, https://si.imgix.net/59b397c8/uploads/origins/f314858e-dd08-4d29-a644-af673a789c41?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ab96d97264534e91f84da0f7ece4fd5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/59b397c8/uploads/origins/f314858e-dd08-4d29-a644-af673a789c41?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1bc49587d9bb8f7164343e689777ee9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！アピールしてくれてありがとう！\n\n私が使っているVtuberのアバターを描いていただけたら嬉しいです。彼女は優秀だけどとても眠そうな研究者で、あらゆる危険な実験や技術に取り組んでいます。\n\n表情、ポーズ、服装は自由に決めてください。もし、彼女の服装をあなたが本当に描きたいものに完全に変更したいのであれば、それは全く問題ありません！\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/deyz01.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@immm86/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/71cfc3df/uploads/origins/5c1d6302-380b-4630-9662-cd0e6435a61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc335b7ea6321f6e759568222a643e3e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/71cfc3df/uploads/origins/5c1d6302-380b-4630-9662-cd0e6435a61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc335b7ea6321f6e759